@startuml layer-component
' Status: Draft. AI-generated; not human reviewed (Constitution Principle VII).
' Syntax not yet checked: PlantUML is not available on the authoring machine.
' Written design: specs/001-splitsmart-expense-sharing/plan.md
title SplitSmart Layers and Dependency Direction (Swing MVP, Draft)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "app" {
  [SplitSmartApplication] as App
  [AppConfig] as Config
}

package "ui (Swing: ID-03)" {
  [Views\nMainFrame, panels, dialogs] as Views
  [Controllers] as Controllers
  [Session] as Session
  [UiAsync\nSwingWorker] as UiAsync
  [DisplayFormats, ErrorPresenter] as UiSupport
}

package "service" {
  [Use-case services\nAccount, Group, Expense, Approval,\nNotification, Balance, Payment, Report] as Services
  [AccessPolicy] as Access
  [PasswordHasher] as Hasher
}

package "domain" {
  [Entities\nUser, Group, Membership, Expense,\nShare, ApprovalDecision, Payment, Notification] as Entities
  [Value objects\nMoney, Percentage, IDs] as Values
  [Policies\nSplitAllocator, BalanceLedger] as Policies
  [Report model] as ReportModel
}

package "repository" {
  interface "Repository interfaces\nand TransactionManager" as RepoApi
  package "repository.sqlite (proposed: PD-06)" {
    [SQLite implementations] as RepoImpl
  }
}

database "SQLite file\n(FR-040, NFR-005)" as Db

Views --> Controllers
Controllers --> UiAsync
Controllers --> Session
Views --> UiSupport
Controllers --> Services : calls off the EDT

Services --> Access
Services --> Hasher
Services --> Entities
Services --> Values
Services --> Policies
Services --> ReportModel
Services --> RepoApi

Policies --> Entities
Policies --> Values
Entities --> Values

RepoImpl ..|> RepoApi
RepoImpl --> Entities
RepoImpl --> Values
RepoImpl --> Db

App --> Config
App --> Views : creates
App --> Services : creates
App --> RepoImpl : creates

note right of Services
  No javax.swing or java.awt in domain, service, or repository
  (Principle III). Checked by a JUnit 5 source scan (PD-14).
  All FR permission checks run here, not in ui (FR-003, NFR-003).
end note

note bottom of Db
  Storage choice is a proposal,
  not a constitution decision.
end note

note left of Views
  OC-1: Swing is implementation decision ID-03.
  It does NOT satisfy CR-10 (primarily web-based).
  OC-1 remains unresolved.
end note

@enduml
